// Great Lakes city (stub): a flat grid city on a lake. Lakefront drive with a beach, a
// dense downtown of mid-century towers, brick three-flats and bungalows on a grid that runs
// to the edge, wide boulevards, an expressway inland, an industrial corridor. No hills, no
// farms. Elevated rail and river bridges come with later stages; see docs/SCENARIOS.md.
//
// Stub: plausible numbers that validate and generate a flat, all-grid place. Tune when the
// scenario is built (M7). Layout and units: crates/world/src/template.rs.
RegionTemplate(
    name: "great_lakes_city",
    driving_side: Right,
    sign_language: EnUs,
    era: EraDefaults(year: 1977, street_lights: Sodium, palette: "brick_and_limestone"),

    coast: Coast(
        side: East,
